WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,450
We finally finished moving. Brother Xiao is a great young man.

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,450
Your strength is really great, Dali Shi

3
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:08,850
Come here are two thousand young men

4
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:11,450
If I still have something to do here, I will go to the labor market to find you and introduce you to a job.

5
00:00:11,450 --> 00:00:18,460
What you did is really great. Thank you for being so polite. Brother Xiao, give me five hundred. Five hundred.

6
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,860
Yes, although the two of us moved together

7
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:20,860
But you moved me alone

8
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:21,860
At least three times the amount

9
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:23,060
Even giving me five hundred is considered too much.

10
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,660
And it was you who took this order.

11
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:25,860
Let's follow the rules

12
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:28,060
You must have more than me, just five hundred

13
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,260
Give me more and I don’t want it

14
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,060
Otherwise I won’t be embarrassed next time

15
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:35,740
Work with you, Brother Xiao

16
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:37,140
Are you still going to do it today?

17
00:00:37,140 --> 00:00:38,340
Can we do it again?

18
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,740
It's only half past two now

19
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:40,940
Is it possible to do it again?

20
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:42,340
But I don’t know if I can pick it up

21
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:47,720
Let's go to the labor market and have a look, Brother Xiao

22
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:50,520
Why don't you buy a mobile phone? We can also contact you via mobile phone.

23
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,520
I want to buy rice

24
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:53,520
Is your family still short of food in today’s society?

25
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:54,520
Who is still short of food?

26
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,520
Everyone works hard to be a cow and a horse

27
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:57,120
Just to live a better life

28
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:58,320
If it’s really for those three meals

29
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,720
Everyone can lie down

30
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:01,180
The most important thing now is

31
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:02,780
Give more food to Shazhou City

32
00:01:02,980 --> 00:01:04,580
Ensure everyone’s food and clothing
